  "date": "2026-09-26",
  "subject": "Bounded ownership analysis deduplicates repeated constructor child shapes",
  "claim": "Repeated construction of acyclic Copy-only records no longer multiplies recursive ownership work. The maintained reproducer executes with result 42 on Windows and Debian and emits identical deterministic bytes. Eight maintained cases, seven original snapshot cases, and 32 reference/candidate comparisons pass per host. The original Package-Lock parser-state snapshot emits successfully; the full typed consumer remains blocked separately.",
